# Title: Execute Code with Pester.bat
# ID: 59e938ff-0d6d-4dc3-b13f-36cc28734d4e
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Julia Fomina, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-08
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1059.001, attack.t1216
# Description: Detects code execution via Pester.bat (Pester - Powershell Modulte for testing)
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_path="*\\powershell.exe" OR process_path="*\\pwsh.exe") AND (process_exec="*Pester*" AND process_exec="*Get-Help*")) OR ((process_path="*\\cmd.exe" AND (process_exec="*pester*" AND process_exec="*;*")) AND ((process_exec="*help*" OR process_exec="*\\?*"))))
